opls-ff-lite: sources of the bundled data and of the data it reads

The opls-ff-lite code (a reduced copy of opls-ff-gen) is released under the MIT
License (LICENSE). The data files in src/opls_ff_lite/data/ come from the sources below, which keep their
own terms.

NOT DISTRIBUTED
  OPLS/2020 parameters (oplsaa2020.par, oplsaa2020.sb). Supporting Information
  of W. L. Jorgensen, M. M. Ghahremanpour, A. Saar and J. Tirado-Rives,
  "OPLS/2020 Force Field for Unsaturated Hydrocarbons, Alcohols, and Ethers",
  J. Phys. Chem. B (2024), doi:10.1021/acs.jpcb.3c06602 (American Chemical
  Society). They may not be redistributed. Each user downloads them and
  installs them with `opls-ff-lite install-si`.

