DERIVED FROM GAFF2 (public domain)
  gaff2_lj.json, gaff2_bonded.json: GAFF2 parameters from gaff2.dat (AMBER
    General Force Field, version 2.2.30, Oct 2025; J. Wang et al., J. Comput.
    Chem. 25, 1157 (2004)), with our own SMARTS typing rules.
  gaff2_general_torsions.par: GAFF2 general torsions converted to OPLS form;
    six central pairs were refitted to GFN2-xTB scans by this project.
  AmberTools/LICENSE (AmberTools 26): "The force field parameter files in the
  dat/leap subdirectory have been placed in the public domain by their
  authors." gaff2.dat is dat/leap/parm/gaff2.dat.

COPIED FROM AMBERTOOLS 26 (GNU GPL, version 3)
  parmchk/PARMCHK.DAT, parmchk/PARM_BLBA_GAFF2.DAT: parmchk2 data files from
  dat/antechamber/, copied unchanged and distributed under the GPL v3 (the
  AmberTools default; the public-domain exception does not cover
  dat/antechamber). The GPL text is in parmchk/AmberTools-LICENSE.txt (the
  unchanged AmberTools/LICENSE); see parmchk/README.txt. opls-ff-lite reads
  them as data. parmchk.py and bonded_substitution.py reimplement the
  parmchk2 substitution steps in Python, following the behaviour of
  AmberTools' parmchk2.c.

OWN WORK OF THIS PROJECT (MIT License)
  atomtype_archive.json, gaff2_opls_analogs.json, gaff2_display_types.json:
    typing rules, precedence and analogs.
  qm_bonded_terms.json, qm_bonded_terms.par: bonds and angles from this
    project's GFN2-xTB fits (modified Seminario method).
  MANIFEST.json: checksums of the files above.

PROGRAM USED AT RUN TIME (installed by the user, not distributed)
  MOPAC (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/openmopac/mopac).
